# Repo layout

See `readme.md` for what the integration does, and `docs/*.md` for per-device-type behavior and testing.

- `custom_components/powerbaas/` — the Home Assistant integration (HACS package).
- Each device type (`devices/boiler_controller/`, `devices/p1_meter/`, `devices/airco_bridge/`) has its own client, controller/coordinator, and entity platform files (`sensor.py`, `number.py`, `select.py`, `button.py`, `climate.py`).
